OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThe evening
OL,6,Fwill start fine with some sunshine,
OL,7,Fand clear spells are likely overnight.
OL,8,FHowever, cloud will increase from the
OL,9,Fwest, with patchy rain starting to
OL,10,Farrive in the west by the morning.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FEarly sunshine is likely in
OL,13,Fthe east on Thursday. However, cloud
OL,14,Fand patchy rain will spread from the
OL,15,Fwest, heralding an increasingly wet
OL,16,Fand breezy afternoon. Heavier rain
OL,17,Farriving later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
